From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rowley <johnrowleyster@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:07:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(miniwin): drop the unused ERROR_SUCCESS from windows.h

libctru's error applet (3ds/applets/error.h, which citro3d.h includes)
declares ERROR_SUCCESS as an enumerator, so the macro broke the Citro3D
backend's build on Nintendo 3DS. Nothing in miniwin or LegoRR reads it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/miniwin/include/miniwin/windows.h b/miniwin/include/miniwin/windows.h
index 2fa659b..58f84e9 100644
--- a/miniwin/include/miniwin/windows.h
+++ b/miniwin/include/miniwin/windows.h
@@ -171,7 +171,6 @@
 #define BITSPIXEL 12
 #define PLANES 14
 
-#define ERROR_SUCCESS 0L
 #define ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS 183L
 
 #define MAKELPARAM(l, h) ((LPARAM) (DWORD) (((WORD) (l)) | (((DWORD) (WORD) (h)) << 16)))
